        "en": "In the afternoon, he feels a little hungry and has a cup of coffee.",
        "zh": "下午，他稍微感到飢餓，喝了一杯咖啡。"
      },
      {
        "en": "At dinner, his family shares hot tea and talks about their day.",
        "zh": "晚餐時，全家一起喝熱茶，談論今天的事。"
      }
    ]
